new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2d3ca99
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/70127.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+The ``diskusage`` beacon now accepts a ``minimum``/``maximum`` mapping per mount, in addition to the existing bare percentage value, to alert when usage drops to or below an expected floor (e.g. a filesystem that silently failed to mount) as well as when it rises above a ceiling. Existing bare-value configuration is unaffected.
diff --git a/salt/beacons/diskusage.py b/salt/beacons/diskusage.py
